OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 16, and 80-year-old man die
OL,4,Ain light aircraft crash near Loch
OL,5,ALomond
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 16-year-old boy and an 80-year-old
OL,8,Fman have died following a light
OL,9,Faircraft crash near Loch Lomond in
OL,10,FScotland.
OL,12,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,13,Fscene of the crash near the village of
OL,14,FDrymen, in the Stirling Council area,
OL,15,Fat about 16:45 BST on Friday.
OL,17,FThe boy and man were pronounced dead
OL,18,Fand their next of kin have been
OL,19,Finformed, police said.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
